    "auction_fees_disclaimer": null,
    "description": "A charming one-bedroom property set on the first floor of this period conversion, located moments from Finsbury Park station for easy access to and from central London. <br /><br />This property features a spacious open plan living/kitchen area, modern kitchen, a modern three-piece bathroom, wooden floor throughout, ample storage, high ceilings and gas central heating. With large windows facing both west and east for plenty of natural light throughout the day. <br /><br />Isledon Road is well-located for access to Finsbury Park (Piccadilly and Victoria lines and National rail lines), with a wealth of shops, gyms, cinemas, parks, cafes, bars, restaurants, and other amenities all within easy walking distance. Offered Part Furnished, Available Now.",
